<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR" xmlns:th="http://www.thymeleaf.org">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>MyCart — Sua lista de compras</title>

    <link rel="stylesheet" th:href="@{/css/output.css}">
</head>

<body class="min-h-screen bg-[#f7f8f5] text-[#1f2933]">

    <!-- NAVBAR -->
    <header class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-6">

        <nav class="flex items-center justify-between">

            <!-- Logo -->
            <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-3">

                <div class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-[#dff3df] text-xl">
                    🛒
                </div>

                <span class="text-xl font-bold">
                    MyCart
                </span>

            </a>


            <!-- Navigation -->
            <div class="hidden items-center gap-8 text-sm font-medium text-gray-500 md:flex">

                <a href="#vantagens" class="transition hover:text-gray-900">
                    Vantagens
                </a>

                <a href="#como-funciona" class="transition hover:text-gray-900">
                    Como funciona
                </a>

            </div>


            <!-- Actions -->
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">

                <a href="/login"
                   class="hidden rounded-xl px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-600 transition hover:bg-white hover:text-gray-900 sm:block">
                    Entrar
                </a>

                <a href="/cadastro"
                   class="rounded-xl bg-[#243b2a] px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-[#1b2e20]">
                    Criar conta
                </a>

            </div>

        </nav>

    </header>


    <!-- HERO -->
    <main>

        <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 pb-24 pt-16 md:pb-32 md:pt-24">

            <div class="grid items-center gap-16 lg:grid-cols-2">


                <!-- TEXT -->
                <div>

                    <div class="mb-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-[#e8f4e8] px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-[#47704e]">

                        <span>✨</span>

                        Organize suas compras de um jeito simples

                    </div>


                    <h1 class="max-w-xl text-5xl font-black leading-[1.05] tracking-tight text-[#243b2a] md:text-6xl">

                        Vá ao mercado
                        <span class="text-[#5a9b61]">
                            sem esquecer nada.
                        </span>

                    </h1>


                    <p class="mt-6 max-w-lg text-lg leading-8 text-gray-500">

                        Crie sua lista, adicione os produtos que precisa
                        e marque cada item conforme coloca no carrinho.

                        <span class="font-medium text-gray-700">
                            É simples assim.
                        </span>

                    </p>


                    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">

                        <a href="/cadastro"
                           class="rounded-2xl bg-[#243b2a] px-7 py-4 text-center font-bold text-white shadow-lg shadow-[#243b2a]/10 transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-[#1b2e20]">

                            Criar minha primeira lista

                        </a>


                        <a href="#como-funciona"
                           class="rounded-2xl bg-white px-7 py-4 text-center font-bold text-gray-700 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-gray-200 transition hover:bg-gray-50">

                            Ver como funciona

                        </a>

                    </div>


                    <!-- Trust -->
                    <div class="mt-8 flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-gray-400">

                        <div class="flex -space-x-2">

                            <div class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-[#f7f8f5] bg-[#dcebdc]">
                                👩
                            </div>

                            <div class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-[#f7f8f5] bg-[#eee0d0]">
                                👨
                            </div>

                            <div class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-[#f7f8f5] bg-[#dedff0]">
                                👩
                            </div>

                        </div>

                        <span>
                            Feito para facilitar sua rotina
                        </span>

                    </div>

                </div>


                <!-- LIST CARD -->
                <div class="relative">


                    <!-- Decorative circles -->
                    <div class="absolute -right-10 -top-10 h-32 w-32 rounded-full bg-[#dcebdc]"></div>

                    <div class="absolute -bottom-10 -left-10 h-24 w-24 rounded-full bg-[#f0e3d1]"></div>


                    <!-- Main card -->
                    <div class="relative rounded-[2rem] bg-white p-6 shadow-xl shadow-gray-200/60 ring-1 ring-gray-100 md:p-8">


                        <!-- Header -->
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">

                            <div>

                                <p class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-400">
                                    LISTA DE COMPRAS
                                </p>

                                <h2 class="mt-1 text-2xl font-bold text-[#243b2a]">
                                    Mercado 🛒
                                </h2>

                            </div>


                            <button class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#e8f4e8] text-lg text-[#47704e] transition hover:bg-[#dcebdc]">
                                +
                            </button>

                        </div>


                        <!-- Date -->
                        <div class="mt-6 flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl bg-[#f7f8f5] px-4 py-3">

                            <span class="text-sm text-gray-500">
                                Compras desta semana
                            </span>

                            <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#47704e]">
                                5 itens
                            </span>

                        </div>


                        <!-- Items -->
                        <div class="mt-5 space-y-2">


                            <!-- Checked -->
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 rounded-2xl p-4 transition hover:bg-gray-50">

                                <div class="flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[#6baa72] text-xs font-bold text-white">
                                    ✓
                                </div>

                                <div class="flex-1">

                                    <p class="font-medium text-gray-400 line-through">
                                        Arroz
                                    </p>

                                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-400">
                                        2 kg
                                    </p>

                                </div>

                            </div>


                            <!-- Item -->
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 rounded-2xl bg-[#fafbf9] p-4">

                                <div class="h-6 w-6 rounded-lg border-2 border-gray-200"></div>

                                <div class="flex-1">

                                    <p class="font-semibold">
                                        Leite
                                    </p>

                                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-400">
                                        3 unidades
                                    </p>

                                </div>

                            </div>


                            <!-- Item -->
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 rounded-2xl bg-[#fafbf9] p-4">

                                <div class="h-6 w-6 rounded-lg border-2 border-gray-200"></div>

                                <div class="flex-1">

                                    <p class="font-semibold">
                                        Pão
                                    </p>

                                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-400">
                                        1 pacote
                                    </p>

                                </div>

                            </div>


                            <!-- Item -->
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 rounded-2xl bg-[#fafbf9] p-4">

                                <div class="h-6 w-6 rounded-lg border-2 border-gray-200"></div>

                                <div class="flex-1">

                                    <p class="font-semibold">
                                        Ovos
                                    </p>

                                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-400">
                                        12 unidades
                                    </p>

                                </div>

                            </div>


                            <!-- Item -->
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 rounded-2xl bg-[#fafbf9] p-4">

                                <div class="h-6 w-6 rounded-lg border-2 border-gray-200"></div>

                                <div class="flex-1">

                                    <p class="font-semibold">
                                        Café
                                    </p>

                                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-400">
                                        500 g
                                    </p>

                                </div>

                            </div>

                        </div>


                        <!-- Bottom -->
                        <div class="mt-5 border-t border-gray-100 pt-5">

                            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">

                                <span class="text-sm text-gray-400">
                                    1 de 5 produtos
                                </span>

                                <span class="text-sm font-bold text-[#5a9b61]">
                                    20%
                                </span>

                            </div>

                            <div class="mt-3 h-2 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-[#edf0eb]">

                                <div class="h-full w-1/5 rounded-full bg-[#6baa72]"></div>

                            </div>

                        </div>

                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>

        </section>


        <!-- SIMPLE MESSAGE -->
        <section class="border-y border-[#e9ebe6] bg-white">

            <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20">

                <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">

                    <span class="text-4xl">
                        💭
                    </span>

                    <h2 class="mt-5 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-[#243b2a] md:text-4xl">

                        "O que eu precisava mesmo era..."

                    </h2>

                    <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-8 text-gray-500">

                        Quantas vezes você já chegou no supermercado
                        e percebeu que esqueceu alguma coisa?

                    </p>

                    <p class="mt-2 font-semibold text-[#5a9b61]">

                        O MyCart existe para isso.

                    </p>

                </div>

            </div>

        </section>


        <!-- FEATURES -->
        <section id="vantagens">

            <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-24">

                <div class="text-center">

                    <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#6baa72]">
                        Por que MyCart?
                    </p>

                    <h2 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-[#243b2a]">
                        Menos preocupação.
                        Mais organização.
                    </h2>

                </div>


                <div class="mt-14 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">


                    <!-- Feature -->
                    <div class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-7 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-gray-100">

                        <div class="flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-[#e8f4e8] text-2xl">
                            📝
                        </div>

                        <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-bold text-[#243b2a]">
                            Crie listas
                        </h3>

                        <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-gray-500">
                            Monte uma lista para cada ocasião.
                            Mercado, feira, churrasco ou qualquer compra.
                        </p>

                    </div>


                    <!-- Feature -->
                    <div class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-7 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-gray-100">

                        <div class="flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-[#f6eadc] text-2xl">
                            🛒
                        </div>

                        <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-bold text-[#243b2a]">
                            Compre sem esquecer
                        </h3>

                        <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-gray-500">
                            Veja exatamente o que falta e marque
                            cada produto conforme compra.
                        </p>

                    </div>


                    <!-- Feature -->
                    <div class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-7 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-gray-100">

                        <div class="flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-[#e5e7f2] text-2xl">
                            ☁️
                        </div>

                        <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-bold text-[#243b2a]">
                            Não perca suas listas
                        </h3>

                        <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-gray-500">
                            Suas listas ficam associadas à sua conta
                            e podem ser acessadas novamente.
                        </p>

                    </div>


                </div>

            </div>

        </section>


        <!-- HOW IT WORKS -->
        <section id="como-funciona" class="bg-[#243b2a]">

            <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-24">

                <div class="max-w-2xl">

                    <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#9bd49f]">
                        Como funciona
                    </p>

                    <h2 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-white md:text-5xl">
                        Três passos.
                        Uma compra muito mais tranquila.
                    </h2>

                </div>


                <div class="mt-14 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-3">


                    <div>

                        <span class="text-5xl font-black text-[#6baa72]">
                            01
                        </span>

                        <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-bold text-white">
                            Crie sua lista
                        </h3>

                        <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-gray-300">
                            Adicione tudo que você precisa comprar.
                        </p>

                    </div>


                    <div>

                        <span class="text-5xl font-black text-[#6baa72]">
                            02
                        </span>

                        <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-bold text-white">
                            Vá às compras
                        </h3>

                        <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-gray-300">
                            Abra sua lista diretamente pelo celular
                            enquanto estiver no supermercado.
                        </p>

                    </div>


                    <div>

                        <span class="text-5xl font-black text-[#6baa72]">
                            03
                        </span>

                        <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-bold text-white">
                            Marque os itens
                        </h3>

                        <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-gray-300">
                            Comprou? Marque. No final, você sabe
                            exatamente o que já está no carrinho.
                        </p>

                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>

        </section>


        <!-- CTA -->
        <section>

            <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-28 text-center">

                <div class="mx-auto flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-3xl bg-[#e8f4e8] text-3xl">
                    🛒
                </div>

                <h2 class="mt-7 text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-[#243b2a] md:text-5xl">
                    Pronto para fazer sua primeira lista?
                </h2>

                <p class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-xl text-lg leading-8 text-gray-500">
                    Crie sua conta gratuitamente e comece
                    a organizar suas compras hoje.
                </p>

                <a href="/cadastro"
                   class="mt-8 inline-block rounded-2xl bg-[#243b2a] px-8 py-4 font-bold text-white transition hover:bg-[#1b2e20]">
                    Começar agora →
                </a>

            </div>

        </section>

    </main>


    <!-- FOOTER -->
    <footer class="border-t border-[#e9ebe6] bg-white">

        <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-8 text-sm text-gray-400 md:flex-row">

            <div class="font-bold text-[#243b2a]">
                My<span class="text-[#6baa72]">Cart</span>
            </div>

            <p>
                © 2026 MyCart. Todos os direitos reservados.
            </p>

        </div>

    </footer>

</body>

</html>